  "StockRole": "Juggernaut & Heavy Cavalry",
  "YangsThoughts": "Designed by Vining Engineering and Salvage Team, the Grand Titan was conceived to take on and defeat any opponent. Built around a 400-rated XL Engine and an Endo Steel chassis, the Grand Titan has 18 tons of armor. The Grand Titan carries a large arsenal of weapons that allow it to work best at short to medium range. The longest-range weapon carried is an Artemis IV enhanced LRM-15 with 2 SRM-6's for closer range engagements.   Two Large Pulse Lasers, two Medium Pulse Lasers and two Small Pulse Lasers provide additional mid to short range firepower.  An AMS system provides a degree of protection from missiles.",
